{"product_id":"literary-non-fiction-collection-new-longman-literature-11-14","title":"Literary Non-fiction Collection (NEW LONGMAN LITERATURE 11-14)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA collection of accessible and engaging literary non-fiction texts, covering a range of vivid and interesting topics including science, sport, reportage and travel writing amongst others. This collection brings together writing from noted authors of literary non-fiction and presents these texts in an accessible way for readers at Key Stage 3, helping students to explore the distinctive features of these stories and how these impact on the reader. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Alastair West \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781405806664 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 216\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44994226127001,"sku":"Table-C-5-9781405806664","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/2b5de636eb272dd8a9bf7cc1f385ea74.jpg?v=1733339466","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/literary-non-fiction-collection-new-longman-literature-11-14","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}